menu "Ægir"

config TRIMIX_ENABLE_WIFI
    bool "Enable ESP-Hosted Wi-Fi service"
    default y
    help
        Start the ESP32-C6 Wi-Fi coprocessor during application boot. Disable
        this for Guition boards whose factory C6 firmware is too old for the
        selected ESP-Hosted host component.

config TRIMIX_UPDATE_C6_ON_BOOT
    bool "Update the Guition ESP32-C6 firmware from the slave_fw partition"
    depends on !TRIMIX_ENABLE_WIFI
    default n
    help
        One-shot recovery option for factory boards. The application validates
        the ESP32-C6 image in the slave_fw partition, updates the coprocessor
        through ESP-Hosted, and restarts. Leave disabled for normal firmware.

endmenu
